        "raw": "<p>I&#39;ve tried searching the forums but can&#39;t quite find an exact answer. &nbsp;This would impact items like Amulet of the Elder Gods, Combat Stance, or Driving Mantis. &nbsp;What I&#39;m trying to figure out is what happens if you take damage in a turn, play one of those cards, and then take damage again does this allow to use that reaction from those cards. &nbsp; The easiest scenario to setup would be Omnitron with Interpolation Beam and Wraith with Impromptu Invention and Combat Stance in hand. &nbsp; So Wraith plays Impromptu Invention, takes damage from card drawing due to Interpolation Beam, and then for the extra card play puts Combat Stance in play. &nbsp;The Wraith draws a card at end of turn and take damage due to Interpolation Beam. &nbsp;Should Wraith be able to deal damage to Omnitron due to Combat Stance? &nbsp; It is mostly a question of whether the card cares only about what happens after it enters play for &quot;first time&quot; or if it looks back at the whole turn it came into play for &quot;first time&quot;.</p>",
