        "cooked": "<p>A part of why I brought this is up is from a thread started in Mega Computer (Alpha testing for the video game) and the response Handelabra got was that it looks back on the whole turn to determine \"first time each turn\". &nbsp; I tried email Christopher to see if it should track from when it entered play as I thought it should but haven't gotten a response.&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks for finding that link Phantaskippy I thought something was out there on this.</p>",
